# The inference image is built with the REPOSITORY ROOT as its context, so that
# COPY can reach both src/ and inference/model/. That makes this file a security
# control, not merely a build-speed optimisation: everything not excluded here is
# uploaded to the Docker daemon and can end up in an image layer.
#
# Two categories matter most:
#   1. Credentials. .env holds a live Cloudflare API token and R2 keys.
#   2. Bulk. data/ is ~863 MB of BTXRD radiographs and .venv/ is a full ROCm
#      torch install; neither belongs in a 4 GiB container.
#
# Deny-listing is used rather than allow-listing because Docker evaluates the
# last matching pattern, and the negations at the bottom are easier to audit than
# a `*` plus a dozen re-inclusions.

# --- Credentials and secrets -------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
.cloudflare-keys.txt
.streamlit/secrets.toml
secrets.toml
*.pem
*.key

# --- Version control and tooling state ---------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.mypy_cache

# --- Local environments ------------------------------------------------------
.venv
venv
env
node_modules

# --- Bulk data that must never enter the image -------------------------------
# The dataset, user uploads and the local SQLite account database.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# --- Training artefacts ------------------------------------------------------
# reports/ holds several 27 MB checkpoints plus Grad-CAM galleries. The ONE
# checkpoint the container needs is staged into inference/model/ by
# scripts/stage_inference_model.py and is re-included at the bottom.
reports/
dist/
notebooks/
wandb/

# --- The old Streamlit application -------------------------------------------
# None of this is imported by the inference service. Excluding it keeps the
# image honest about what it actually runs.
app.py
review_app.py
run_local.py
.streamlit/
assets/
tests/
compliance/
cloudflare/
web/
functions/
deploy/
configs/
*.md

# --- Frontend build output ---------------------------------------------------
web/dist/
.wrangler/

# --- Re-included on purpose --------------------------------------------------
# The staged model. inference/model/ is gitignored (weights must never be public)
# but it is exactly what this image exists to serve.
!inference/model/
